Artwork provenance
------------------
The coloured key artwork and plugin/category images under assets/ and the plugin's imgs/
folder (other than the Lucide icons above) are original, AI-generated artwork, created with
a generative image model driven by scripts/render-with-codex.py from prompts that contain no
reference to any brand, logo or product photo. They have been looked at by AI agents only (the generating run and the integrating
assistant); the maintainer has not reviewed them yet and should before a release. Raw rendered
output stays untracked. Whether and how AI-generated images are protected by copyright is
unsettled, so no copyright claim is made for them beyond what the law grants.
Process and prompts: docs/RENDERING.md.
